stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Proposed: PathBundle + mechanism hypothesis
  Proposed --> Auditable: provenance / scope / version complete
  Auditable --> Estimable: treatment fixed + propensity overlap
  Estimable --> Supported: effect interval crosses materiality threshold
  Supported --> StableScoped: direction stable across predefined environments
  StableScoped --> CausalQualified: negative controls and rule–evidence checks pass

  Proposed --> Unresolved: representation conflict
  Auditable --> NonIdentifiable: overlap / ESS failure
  Estimable --> Conflicted: effect direction conflict
  Supported --> OutOfScope: task / actor / time / tool mismatch
  StableScoped --> Conflicted: drift or version reversal
  CausalQualified --> StableScoped: new evidence widens uncertainty
  CausalQualified --> OutOfScope: scope changes

  Unresolved --> Proposed: reparse / audit
  NonIdentifiable --> Auditable: exploration or safe replay
  Conflicted --> Estimable: stratified estimate / cluster intervention
  OutOfScope --> Auditable: requalify in new scope

  CausalQualified --> Protected: scope matches
  StableScoped --> ConditionalKeep: stable association / partial support
  NonIdentifiable --> ConservativeKeep: high forgetting cost
  Unresolved --> Isolated: unsafe by default
  Conflicted --> Isolated: conflict unresolved
  ConditionalKeep --> Downweighted: aging / low incremental value
  Downweighted --> Archived: leave hot index
  Archived --> Restored: new task / evidence / drift reversal
  Isolated --> Restored: conflict resolved / access restored
  Restored --> Auditable: re-enter qualification
